# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the tsan test preset: races inside third-party code we
# don't build with TSan and can't fix. Never suppress a race in our own code here; fix it.
#
# Mesa's llvmpipe (lavapipe, the CI driver) destroys a fence's mutex while its rasterizer
# threads may still touch it (lp_fence_destroy). Matched by function where Mesa has symbols
# (Arch, via debuginfod) and by library where it doesn't (Ubuntu's packages, in CI): the
# reports there show only libvulkan_lvp.so offsets. A race with a frame in lavapipe is
# lavapipe's to fix.
race:lp_fence_destroy
race:libvulkan_lvp.so
